[35m[3mcodex[0m[0m
The red tests exposed four definite gaps, and the independent diagnosis found another one directly illustrated by the spec: on an open `atom`, `_` followed by `:x` must report `unreachable_arm`, but the finite-domain sentinel path currently loses literal reachability.

I’m handing `switchcheck` to a separate implementation agent now. It owns only that executable; the diagnostic and authoring passes remain separate, and `cases/` stays untouched.
